    { "f": 160.650, "n": "The rail crossroads — scan 160.215–161.565", "z": "铁路十字路口 · 扫 160.215–161.565", "c": "rail", "m": "NFM", "conf": "high", "a": "Freight Rail", "d": "More freight tonnage passes through Chicago than anywhere else in North America. BNSF, Union Pacific, CSX, Norfolk Southern, Canadian National and Canadian Pacific Kansas City all meet here, all on analog AAR channels. Rochelle, Blue Island and the Belt Railway yards are legendary listening spots — bring the whole band and a folding chair.", "dz": "经过芝加哥的货运吨位超过北美任何地方。BNSF、联合太平洋、CSX、诺福克南方、加拿大国家铁路和 CPKC 全在此交汇，全部使用模拟 AAR 频道。Rochelle、Blue Island 和 Belt Railway 编组场是传奇的收听地点——把整个频段带上，再带一张折叠椅。", "odds": 1 },
